the post of the Pro Vice Chancellor (Administation and Finance) shall be asprescribed.(3) The ho Vice Chancellor (Admini ion and Finanoe) shall supervise,undertake, and coordinate all administrative and financial activities of principal seatof the Institute.(i) The Pro Vice Chancellor of adminisfration and Finance shall exercise theadministrative and fin cial powers as delegated by the Board ofGovernors;(ii) e Pro Vice Chancellor of administration and finance shall be theoonvener of all the financial, adminisfative, and other relevantcommittees of the University;(iii) The Pro Vioe Chancellor of administration and finance shall perform theof member Finance Committee and sign the payment cheques asco signatory wi Director Finance;(lv) The Pro Vice Chancellor shall be responsible to process and paymedical bills of o cers and other staffofthe University;(v) The oard of Governors (BoG), or the Vice Chanoellor may assignany o er functions to the ho Vice Chancellor of adminisfration andFinance:Provided that the Board of Governors may, on the advice of theVice Chancellor te inate the appointnent of the Pro Vice Chancellorof Academics and search on grounds of inefficiency or misconduct inaccordance with prescribed procedure.
