sssAssThe Islamabad Universlty of ealth Sciences and Emerging Technologies,Isl abad, a private sector entity, is a project of ABLE LEARNING (P VATE)L ITE duly registered with Security Exchange Commission of Pakistan under theCo anies Ac! 2017 as non profit organization for establishing a new university inIslamabad. The p ose of the university is to disseminate knowledge education inthe field of technological research and other technical subjects. The main seat ofuniversity will be in Isl abad with regional c uses in all over the Pakistan.The Bill seeks to achieve the above said objects though the above university in aprivate sector.
